4Shell 존재 = Phase 2 근거)&lt;br&gt;• DB 접속정보는 빌드 시점 &lt;code&gt;mvnw -Djdbc.*&lt;/code&gt; 주입 (런타임 주입은 이 앱에서 무시됨)&lt;br&gt;• WEB/WAS 퍼블릭 IP 없음 · 22번 없음 · Bastion 없음 (SSM)&lt;br&gt;• Public ALB SG는 팀 IP만 또는 0.0.0.0/0 + 리전 WAF&lt;br&gt;• 완성본 AMI v1 = Phase 2 롤백 지점" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#0B5394;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="300" width="470" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;SG 체인 (소스 = 앞 단계 SG)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sg-alb-public 80 ← 팀 IP / 0.0.0.0/0&lt;br&gt;sg-web 80 ← sg-alb-public&lt;br&gt;sg-alb-internal 8080 ← sg-web&lt;br&gt;sg-was 8080 ← sg-alb-internal&lt;br&gt;sg-rds 3306 ← sg-was&lt;br&gt;22번 · 0.0.0.0/0 규칙 없음" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#0B5394;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="510" width="470" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="&lt;b&gt;완료 기준&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 도메인으로 점검표 5장(조회/등록/수정/vets.json/oups)&lt;br&gt;• test.jsp: OpenJDK 1.8 · Tomcat 9.0.53 · DB OK · vets 6행, 새로고침마다 WAS-A/C 교대&lt;br&gt;• 4대 healthy · AMI mc-web-v1 · mc-was-v1&lt;br&gt;• trivy: CVE-2022-22965 캡처 (Before)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#0B5394;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="690" width="470" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F6FB;strokeColor=#0B5394;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="860" width="470" height="138" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-t" value="범례" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0B5394;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1474" y="870" width="442" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-b" value="&lt;div style='margin:3px 0'&gt;■ 실선 = 요청 흐름 (사용자 → DB)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin:3px 0'&gt;■ 점선 양방향 = 복제 · 운영 접속 · 비밀 조회&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='margin:3px 0'&gt;As-Is 대비 추가: Internal ALB · WEB-C · WAS-C · RDS · Route 53 · SSM · Secrets · AMI v1&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1474" y="902" width="442" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>